[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20522.708, "timestamp": "05:42:02", "text": "呃，就是一些在线课程、培训班之类的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20525.27, "timestamp": "05:42:05", "text": "我一直在看你玩音乐冲刺。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20526.788, "timestamp": "05:42:06", "text": "乐趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20529.75, "timestamp": "05:42:09", "text": "祝你好运。谢谢你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20531.75, "timestamp": "05:42:11", "text": "路过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20533.91, "timestamp": "05:42:13", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20535.67, "timestamp": "05:42:15", "text": "喜欢在《我的世界》里闲逛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20538.15, "timestamp": "05:42:18", "text": "总有一天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20541.43, "timestamp": "05:42:21", "text": "今天Vama来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20544.47, "timestamp": "05:42:24", "text": "谢谢你今天再次光临。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20546.948, "timestamp": "05:42:26", "text": "希望你今天过得愉快。谢谢。然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20549.27, "timestamp": "05:42:29", "text": "最后但同样重要的是，还有一项特别的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20551.99, "timestamp": "05:42:31", "text": "特别感谢，以及非常非常多的感谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20556.15, "timestamp": "05:42:36", "text": "心形和头巾要去伊萨玛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20558.83, "timestamp": "05:42:38", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20565.43, "timestamp": "05:42:45", "text": "邀请并建议进行此次合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20568.15, "timestamp": "05:42:48", "text": "我们一直都想合作很久了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20571.83, "timestamp": "05:42:51", "text": "尽管。或许在计划和工作中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20574.47, "timestamp": "05:42:54", "text": "终于像我们原本计划的那样合作了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20578.628, "timestamp": "05:42:58", "text": "上周，但是呃，Arushama的电脑是呃"}]